# Feature tracker

`docs/feature-tracker/` is the Done / Pending source of truth.

After implementing or deliberately deferring work:

1. Find the row in the matching category file (auth, access-grants, admin-content, exam-results, examinee-tracking, security, diagnostic, weekly-regimen).
2. Set **Status** to **Done** or **Pending**. Add a short **Notes** line when useful.
3. If no row exists, add one in the best-fit category (or a new category file + link from the tracker README).

Also update `docs/features/`, `docs/models/`, or `docs/pages/` when behavior, fields, or screens change.

Skip the tracker only for Cursor/config-only changes with no product behavior.
